    {
      "text": "带有“Hardware profile”标签框的 UML 类图。框上方为 Core/ Specification 和 Core/ Element。ProductSpecification（hazard: DefinedType [0..*]）特化 Core/Specification。抽象类 Hardware 特化 Core/Element，具有属性 productAgent :Agent [1]、hardwareVersion:xsd:string [0..1]、partNumber : xsd:string [1]、releaseDate :DateTime [0..1]、serialNumber : xsd:string [0..1]、batchNumber : xsd:string [0..1]、hazard: DefinedType [0..*]、category: DefinedType [0..*]、additionalInformationSpecification : /Core/Specification [0..*] 和 additionalInformation :/Core/DictionaryEntry [0..*]。三个类特化 Hardware：PhysicalHardware（massOfHardware: MeasureOfMass [0..1]、dimensions : Dimensions [0..1]、centerOfMass : Dimensions [0..1]）；BulkHardware（bulkQuantity :Core/UnitofMeasure，外加两行标红属性：/Hardware/Hardware/serialNumber : xsd:string [0] 和 /Core/Element/description :xsd:string [1]）；以及 VirtualHardware（virtualHardwareModel: VirtualHardwareModelType [0..1]）。独立的 Dimensions 类包含 xAxisLength、yAxisLength 和 zAxisLength，类型均为 : MeasureOfLength [1]，“Enumerations”框中包含 VirtualHardwareModelType。",
